 "description": "Eating out shouldn\u2019t ruin your progress. \nBut most restaurant menus don\u2019t show calories \u2014 and guessing almost always leads to overeating.\nFoodieFit helps you understand any menu, see calories and macros, and choose meals that actually fit your goals \u2014 in seconds. No guessing. No stress. No \u201cI\u2019ll fix it tomorrow.\u201d\n\nMake the right choice \u2014 before you order\nMost nutrition apps track what you already ate.\n\nFoodieFit helps you decide what to eat \u2014 before you order.\nWhether you're trying to lose weight, hit your protein goal, or stay on track, FoodieFit turns confusing menus into clear, confident decisions.\n\nScan any menu. Understand it instantly.\nJust take a photo \u2014 FoodieFit does the rest.\n-  Instantly transforms menu text into a visual, easy-to-understand layout\n-  Shows estimated calories and macros (protein, carbs, fat) for each dish\n-  Compare options side by side and spot better choices in seconds\nNo more decoding descriptions. Just scan, see, and decide.\n\n Stay on track \u2014 even when eating out\n No nutrition info? No problem.\n-  Avoid hidden high-calorie meals\n-  Stay within your calorie target\n-  Find high-protein, better-balanced options fast\n Make decisions with confidence \u2014 even at restaurants that don\u2019t provide clear data.\n\n  Find meals that actually fit your goals\n Trying to:\n-  stay in a calorie deficit\n-  hit your daily protein target\n-  avoid going over carbs or fat\n FoodieFit recommends menu items that align with your goal \u2014 so you don\u2019t have to calculate everything yourself.\n\n Built for real-life moments\n Standing in line. Sitting with friends.\n Scrolling a menu under pressure.\n FoodieFit is designed for that exact moment \u2014 when you need a fast, smart decision without overthinking.\n\n Smarter search. Better choices.\n Explore meals, compare options, and quickly find better picks \u2014\n without digging through social media, websites, or random photos.\n\n Made for people who want real results\n Perfect for:\n-  calorie & macro tracking\n-  weight loss without giving up eating out\n-  fitness & gym lifestyles\n-  anyone who wants more control when ordering\n\n[About FoodieFit Premium]\n-  Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase\n-  Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period\n-  Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period\n-  Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when purchasing a subscription\n-  Subscriptions can be managed in your iTunes Account settings\n\nTerm of Use: https://app-service.eatoutfit.com/static/user_agreement.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://app-service.eatoutfit.com/static/privacy_policy.html",
